<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Sept seat load factor up 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Sept seat load factor up 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa's seat load factor in September was 76.9 percent, up 0.6 percentage points from a year ago, the airlines investor relations department said.</p>
<p>Details published for September compared with year ago figures included.</p>
<p> Total passengers (group) (million)   4.05   up 4.1 pct</p>
<p> Available seat kilometres (million) 10.13   up 3.7 pct</p>
<p> Revenue seat kilometres (million)    7.79   up 4.6 pct</p>
<p> Seat load factor		     76.9   up 0.6 pct points.</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsdesk Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
